 meet you” ဟု ယဉ်ကျေးစွာ ပြောနိုင်သည်။"}},{"id":"a1-c1-q5","prompt":"Choose the correct introduction.","skill":"writing","options":[{"id":"option-1","text":"My name are Su."},{"id":"option-2","text":"I from Myanmar."},{"id":"option-3","text":"My name is Su. I am from Myanmar."}],"correctOptionId":"option-3","explanation":{"en":"Use is with “my name” and am with I.","my":"“my name” နှင့် is၊ I နှင့် am ကို သုံးပါ။"}}]}]}]'::jsonb) item;
